<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/backend.css?v=<%= cssVer %>"></head><body class="teacher-body"><%- include('partials/sidebar') %><div class="teacher-main"><%- include('partials/header') %><main class="teacher-content"><h1>工作台</h1><p>欢迎，<%= teacherName %>。当前身份：<%= access.roles[adminAccount.role] %></p><p>左侧展示已授权功能。需要调整权限时，请联系 超级账号管理员。</p><div class="card-grid"><% Object.entries(access.modules).forEach(([key,label])=>{ if(canAdmin(key)){ %><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2><%= label %></h2><p><%= canAdmin(key,true)?'管理权限':'仅查看' %></p></div></div><% }}); %></div></main></div><script>document.getElementById('sidebarToggle')?.addEventListener('click',()=>document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open'));</script></body></html>
